docs {
  ## Revoke Celcom Sender

  Bruno: `admin/Revoke Celcom Sender`

  Sets `active: false` on the shortcode - `sms/send` requests for that `sender` immediately
  start failing with "No active Celcom credentials configured for sender '...'" instead of
  going out. Reverse with `admin/Activate Celcom Sender`.

  Code source: `CelcomSenderControllerImpl.revokeCelcomSender` / `CelcomSenderServiceImpl.revokeCelcomSender`.
}
